    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/radiant-mega-shop/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Radiant Mega Shop is a versatile and feature-rich e-commerce theme designed for online stores, retail shops, fashion boutiques, electronics outlets, marketplaces, supermarkets, apparel, accessories, home décor, furniture, beauty products, jewelry, cosmetics, lifestyle brands, and general online retail businesses. With its modern, visually appealing, and fully responsive design, this theme ensures a seamless shopping experience across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. Radiant Mega Shop includes customizable layouts, color schemes, and fonts to align with your brand identity, while sections for product listings, featured items, promotional banners, and customer reviews enhance product visibility and engagement. Integrated with WooCommerce for easy product, category, and order management, as well as popular payment gateways for secure transactions, the theme simplifies online store operations. Additionally, it supports Contact Form 7 for inquiries and SEO plugins to boost search engine rankings, helping your store attract more customers and maximize sales. Demo: https://preview.wpradiant.net/radiant-mega-shop/"
    },
